#: 70dbf78c97284f33b9179aae5ded9163
msgid ""
"Compact mode is a context window optimization that exposes only 4-5 core "
"discovery tools instead of listing all 1000+ tools. All tools remain "
"accessible through the ``execute_tool`` function."
