"available tools 2. Use ``grep_tools(pattern=\"...\")`` to search for "
"tools 3. Use ``get_tool_info(tool_names=\"...\")`` to get details 4. Use "
"``execute_tool(tool_name=\"...\", arguments={...})`` to execute tools"
